# UI catalog

Before adding, restyling, or composing UI, read [docs/ui-catalog.md](docs/ui-catalog.md).

- Reuse listed primitives (`#/components/ui/*`) and feature components. Do not invent a second Button, Dialog, or table.
- Treat Figma / design-tool output as intent. Remap to catalog components; do not paste generated one-off widgets.
- Destructive confirm → `AlertDialog`. Forms → `Field` + TanStack Form. Tables → `useAppTable` + `DataTable`.
- If you add, rename, or delete a page or component, update `docs/ui-catalog.md` in the same change.
